      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.john_kalybites.budge:1-45",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲡⲉϫⲁⲓ ⲛⲁϥ ϫⲉⲁⲣⲓⲧⲁⲅⲁⲡⲏ ⲱ ⲡⲁⲉⲓⲱⲧ ⲛⲅϫⲓⲟⲩ**ϣⲏⲙ** ⲛⲧⲣⲟⲫⲏ ϫⲉⲉⲓⲥ ϥⲧⲟⲟⲩ ⲛϩⲟⲟⲩ ⲙⲡⲉⲕϫⲓϯⲡⲉ ⲛⲗⲁⲁⲩ",
      "english": "And I said unto him, 'Do one act of grace, O my father, and partake of a very small quantity of nourishment, for behold, it is now four days since thou hast tasted anything at all.'",
      "source": "Life of Pisentius part 3",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.pisentius.budge:58-84",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
